WEBVTT

00:14.910 --> 00:16.710
Don't do it, Slugna!

00:19.950 --> 00:21.580
Someone's shifting.

00:21.580 --> 00:23.210
Who?

00:27.820 --> 00:35.560
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:35.560 --> 00:42.530
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:55.880 --> 01:02.090
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

01:02.090 --> 01:09.050
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:09.260 --> 01:15.570
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:15.570 --> 01:22.700
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:25.150 --> 01:32.550
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:32.550 --> 01:38.530
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:38.530 --> 01:46.170
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:46.170 --> 01:53.040
Tooku tooi basho e to

02:00.420 --> 02:04.440
Episode 16
A Tragic Race

02:44.030 --> 02:46.150
Kill anyone who opposes us.

02:49.660 --> 02:52.130
Well, assuming anyone does...

03:01.980 --> 03:04.270
Don't ! Please don't !

03:10.150 --> 03:11.950
Princess Rebecca!

03:26.900 --> 03:28.540
You're Zed, aren't you?

03:28.540 --> 03:30.330
Who are you?

03:33.310 --> 03:34.780
You're...

03:35.210 --> 03:37.840
I will get out of here alive!

03:41.620 --> 03:42.920
So, you pulled through.

03:42.920 --> 03:44.450
Do you know him?

03:44.450 --> 03:45.750
Sort of...

03:45.750 --> 03:49.390
I'm sorry to ask you this, but I'd like
you to come with me to Kalb-Hu.

03:49.390 --> 03:51.030
That's pretty out of the blue.

03:51.030 --> 03:53.430
It's an order from Princess Rebecca.

03:53.430 --> 03:55.000
What? Rebecca?

03:55.000 --> 03:57.230
Rebecca's alive?

03:57.230 --> 03:59.330
Who the hell are you?

03:59.330 --> 04:01.300
How do you know Rebecca?!

04:04.810 --> 04:08.510
I see, so your people saved Rebecca.

04:08.510 --> 04:11.480
Fortunately, her injuries were not severe.

04:11.480 --> 04:15.950
She is now favoring us with her assistance.

04:15.950 --> 04:17.250
So, she's okay?

04:17.250 --> 04:18.420
That's great!

04:18.420 --> 04:20.290
I was so sure that...

04:20.290 --> 04:22.320
You'd better not be lying.

04:22.320 --> 04:23.320
Zed!

04:23.320 --> 04:27.450
What proof do you have that you
really know Rebecca?

04:28.500 --> 04:31.970
There's the possibility that this
is just a trap, you know.

04:31.970 --> 04:33.400
The princess told me,

04:33.400 --> 04:37.840
"In Templar, there is a shard caster named Zed."

04:37.840 --> 04:40.210
"He owes me a favor."

04:40.210 --> 04:43.340
"He is not the kind of person
who will forget that."

04:44.080 --> 04:45.880
A favor, huh?

04:47.320 --> 04:49.720
All right, I'll go.

04:49.720 --> 04:51.990
Huh? You're going?

04:51.990 --> 04:54.820
Rebecca's asking me for help.

04:54.820 --> 04:56.890
I'm going to go pay back what I owe her.

04:56.890 --> 04:58.860
Hold on, Zed!

04:58.860 --> 05:00.800
If you're going, I'm going too!

05:00.800 --> 05:02.760
That's out of the question!

05:04.000 --> 05:05.300
Old man...

05:05.300 --> 05:09.400
We come to investigate the shifting sensed
here, and look what we find!

05:09.400 --> 05:12.940
This isn't just your personal issue.

05:12.940 --> 05:15.440
It's an international matter.

05:15.440 --> 05:19.550
As members of Templar's Council,
we cannot permit this.

05:19.550 --> 05:22.950
So, are you saying we should
abandon Rebecca?!

05:22.950 --> 05:25.120
You must not go!

05:25.120 --> 05:29.060
I'm afraid I have to ask you to leave,
man from Kalb-Hu.

05:29.060 --> 05:31.130
I feel badly for you,

05:31.130 --> 05:33.920
but there is nothing we can do.

05:34.360 --> 05:39.660
I give you my word that if you leave now,
I will keep your visit a secret.

05:40.300 --> 05:41.140
Go on.

05:41.140 --> 05:41.840
Old man!
Go on.

05:41.840 --> 05:43.040
Old man!
Zed!

05:43.040 --> 05:45.510
I'll withdraw for today.

05:46.040 --> 05:47.080
Okay?

05:47.080 --> 05:48.310
Master Zico!

05:48.310 --> 05:50.780
Do not act thoughtlessly!

05:51.410 --> 05:54.050
You should realize your position here.

05:54.050 --> 05:55.850
But...

05:55.850 --> 05:58.480
This is how politics is.

06:00.720 --> 06:02.920
I apologize for the suddenness of my request.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.890
I'll see you again.

06:20.740 --> 06:25.540
After all, Kalb-Hu has always been
basically a vassal state of Zymot.

06:26.380 --> 06:28.350
That's not a nice way to put it!

06:28.920 --> 06:32.420
If there's one thing I can't comprehend here,

06:32.420 --> 06:37.380
it's why Zymot would go to the trouble
of invading Kalb-Hu now.

06:39.830 --> 06:42.930
Well, I'm sure they have their reasons.

06:42.930 --> 06:45.770
Damn it, you talk like it's got
nothing to do with you.

06:45.770 --> 06:47.940
That's right, it doesn't .

06:47.940 --> 06:50.040
Just think about it for a second.

06:50.040 --> 06:53.980
What would be the point of Templar
siding with Kalb-Hu?

06:53.980 --> 06:55.980
Rebecca would be saved.

06:55.980 --> 06:57.410
Yes, one person:

06:57.410 --> 07:02.280
a ruined princess in exile who's lost her spirit.

07:02.280 --> 07:04.290
That's not a nice way to put it...

07:04.290 --> 07:06.910
Oh, am I wrong?

07:08.190 --> 07:09.760
Friendship, obligation, compassion...

07:09.760 --> 07:12.190
They're all fine things.

07:12.190 --> 07:14.430
But there's also the danger

07:14.430 --> 07:18.270
that those things could lead
to war between nations.

07:18.270 --> 07:20.470
That'd be a big loss to suffer, wouldn't it?

07:20.470 --> 07:22.370
It's not about gains or losses...

07:22.370 --> 07:23.700
You're so young.

07:23.700 --> 07:25.110
I'm jealous!

07:25.110 --> 07:29.880
That youthful ignorance is really what
makes this world go round, isn't it?

07:29.880 --> 07:31.010
I'm going home.

07:31.010 --> 07:32.810
Wait, Zed!

07:38.990 --> 07:41.160
First Master Zico, now Master Robès.

07:41.160 --> 07:43.450
Why do adults always talk like that?

07:43.860 --> 07:45.690
Nations... politics...

07:45.690 --> 07:48.060
Are they really that important?

07:48.060 --> 07:50.930
How am I supposed to understand
relations between countries

07:50.930 --> 07:54.040
when I hardly even know about myself?

07:54.040 --> 07:56.000
What's that supposed to mean?

07:57.370 --> 08:00.170
Nothing, really...

08:08.680 --> 08:12.310
Hey! What's your game, holding us
hostage in a place like this?

08:14.320 --> 08:19.230
If Lady Elmeida finds out about this,
none of you will survive!

08:19.230 --> 08:21.020
If she finds out?

08:29.740 --> 08:32.540
Y..You're Princess Rebecca!

08:34.010 --> 08:36.140
There's something I want to ask.

08:42.620 --> 08:45.120
What is Hugh thinking?

08:45.120 --> 08:48.490
What does he want with a backwater
like this so late in the game?

08:48.490 --> 08:50.960
We don't know anything!

09:02.540 --> 09:05.210
I'll ask again.

09:05.210 --> 09:07.940
What is Hugh thinking?

09:07.940 --> 09:10.280
We really don't know anything!

09:10.280 --> 09:12.910
We just follow Lady Elmeida's orders!

09:14.150 --> 09:16.950
I see, so you don't know.

09:21.190 --> 09:25.820
Pl..Pl..Please! Sp..Spare me!

09:38.670 --> 09:40.170
That's so mean.

09:40.170 --> 09:41.440
Roya...

09:41.440 --> 09:44.240
Do you mean to go by yourself, Zed?

09:46.750 --> 09:48.680
You stay here.

09:48.680 --> 09:49.920
Why?

09:49.920 --> 09:51.450
Just stay here.

09:51.450 --> 09:53.220
Who cares about a little punishment?

09:53.220 --> 09:56.460
I'm not scared of that stupid Council.

09:56.460 --> 10:00.490
I'm worried about Rebecca too, you know!

10:00.490 --> 10:02.460
Whatever, suit yourself.

10:18.450 --> 10:20.240
I knew you'd come.

10:21.020 --> 10:23.480
As if I could stay home.

10:37.030 --> 10:40.490
Wow, it's so lovely!

10:41.840 --> 10:43.870
Is this Kalb-Hu?

10:43.870 --> 10:46.500
It sure doesn't look very oppressed.

10:48.580 --> 10:53.810
We are told that the landscape
aboveground was once as beautiful,

10:53.810 --> 10:56.280
before it was occupied by Zymot.

10:58.450 --> 10:59.790
Come on, let's go.

10:59.790 --> 11:01.920
Just follow me.

11:01.920 --> 11:03.890
We don't want to cause a commotion.

11:04.530 --> 11:06.320
What's that mean?

11:32.450 --> 11:33.920
Very soon...

11:33.920 --> 11:36.890
Very soon, we'll get to meet our children.

11:37.830 --> 11:40.620
Who is that? Guzma?

11:42.760 --> 11:45.230
I've brought them, Lucia.

11:46.370 --> 11:47.990
Truly?

11:51.240 --> 11:53.370
So, he really is the man from that day.

11:53.370 --> 11:54.580
That's right.

11:54.580 --> 11:57.700
These two say they're going to help us.

11:58.280 --> 12:01.750
I'm going to contact Princess Rebecca.

12:01.750 --> 12:03.380
All right.

12:08.490 --> 12:10.730
These are...

12:10.730 --> 12:13.260
Zed, these are eggs.

12:13.260 --> 12:15.400
Babies are going to be born!

12:15.400 --> 12:16.730
Babies?

12:16.730 --> 12:18.200
Right?

12:18.200 --> 12:22.440
Yes, that's why this is a holy place.

12:22.440 --> 12:26.900
Our beloved children will be born,
under the protective wing of God.

12:28.610 --> 12:31.280
They're born from eggs?

12:31.280 --> 12:34.410
Let us see your faces, foreign visitors.

12:36.120 --> 12:37.740
Zed...

12:47.800 --> 12:50.770
Wait, everyone, these two...

12:50.770 --> 12:53.470
Lucia, who are they?

12:53.470 --> 12:55.040
Guzma brought them here.

12:55.040 --> 12:56.640
They must be allies.

12:56.640 --> 12:58.260
What?

13:00.070 --> 13:02.010
So, they've been found?

13:02.010 --> 13:04.640
Everyone, rejoice!

13:08.450 --> 13:10.720
There's nothing to be afraid of now!

13:10.720 --> 13:12.850
We have gained power!

13:13.120 --> 13:14.460
What do you mean?

13:14.460 --> 13:17.930
This man is a top shard caster from Templar.

13:17.930 --> 13:21.800
He's going to fight alongside us
and Princess Rebecca.

13:21.800 --> 13:24.030
" Top shard caster, " he said.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.400
Now, hold on, Guzma.

13:25.400 --> 13:29.040
We haven't yet decided to fight the Zymot Army.

13:29.040 --> 13:30.940
Their messenger will arrive any moment.

13:30.940 --> 13:32.270
Then, we'll reopen...

13:32.270 --> 13:34.340
No! You're wrong!

13:34.340 --> 13:38.780
We don't have to put up with
Zymot's tyranny anymore!

13:38.780 --> 13:41.350
We've lived overburdened with taxes,
captured for soldiers,

13:41.350 --> 13:44.080
eager like dogs to avoid
displeasing our masters!

13:44.080 --> 13:46.920
Now, we'll say goodbye to that life!

13:46.920 --> 13:50.380
Kalb-Hu will win independence,
and take back its pride!

13:51.560 --> 13:53.190
Guzma...

13:56.200 --> 13:58.200
Princess Rebecca is waiting for you.

13:58.200 --> 14:01.000
I'll show you the way, Zed.

14:09.180 --> 14:11.150
Master Zed...

14:11.150 --> 14:13.380
After you've met with Princess Rebecca,

14:13.380 --> 14:17.280
would you be willing to go back to Templar?

14:17.280 --> 14:19.590
If the messenger finds out you're here,
it will cause trouble.

14:19.590 --> 14:20.750
But why?

14:20.750 --> 14:24.490
We came here to help Kalb-Hu.

14:24.490 --> 14:27.090
We heard it was what Rebecca wanted...

14:27.090 --> 14:29.260
Your desire to support us is gift enough.

14:29.260 --> 14:32.300
Kemp is a coward who refuses to fight.

14:32.300 --> 14:34.070
Guzma!

14:34.070 --> 14:36.070
Am I wrong, brother?!

14:36.070 --> 14:39.970
They pick a fight with us,
and that doesn't piss you off?!

14:39.970 --> 14:41.600
Guzma...

14:42.380 --> 14:44.880
Kalb-Hu's greatest misfortune

14:44.880 --> 14:47.850
is that it allowed a man like
Kemp to be its leader.

14:48.520 --> 14:51.810
Princess Rebecca will guide Kalb-Hu.

14:56.720 --> 15:00.680
Princess Rebecca, I have brought
our allies from Templar!

15:06.230 --> 15:08.340
Rebecca!

15:08.340 --> 15:10.630
Zed, Roya...

15:11.670 --> 15:13.640
I'm so glad you've come.

15:18.080 --> 15:20.810
Agonizing over it won't do any good.

15:20.810 --> 15:22.980
Roya's an adult now.

15:22.980 --> 15:24.820
She has her own will.

15:24.820 --> 15:27.450
You can try to hide it,

15:27.450 --> 15:29.920
but one day she's sure to arrive at the truth.

15:31.290 --> 15:35.000
So, you think I should just leave her alone?

15:35.000 --> 15:36.830
Well...

15:36.830 --> 15:39.430
Should I tell her myself?

15:39.430 --> 15:43.270
Or leave her to find out on her own?

15:43.270 --> 15:45.710
Either will cause her pain,

15:45.710 --> 15:50.670
and perhaps even destroy her very self.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.950
It's called " Zymot" now,

15:59.950 --> 16:02.290
but this was originally the land of the Kalb-Hu.

16:02.290 --> 16:07.420
Long ago, we invaded this land
and took it from them.

16:08.400 --> 16:12.300
However, they were promised that
we would never set foot

16:12.300 --> 16:15.430
in this underground territory where they live.

16:16.770 --> 16:20.230
But Hugh broke that promise!

16:21.080 --> 16:24.040
I will not let him do as he pleases any longer!

16:28.350 --> 16:31.650
You've changed somehow, Rebecca.

16:32.250 --> 16:34.220
Me?

16:36.360 --> 16:38.430
You may be right!

16:38.430 --> 16:42.380
Because I have essentially died
and been reborn.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.500
We have much to talk about.

16:45.500 --> 16:48.570
I'm sorry, but please let us talk privately.

16:48.570 --> 16:50.370
Of course.

16:55.040 --> 16:58.380
The people are accustomed to oppression.

16:58.380 --> 17:01.450
Their race has never enjoyed battle.

17:01.450 --> 17:04.520
They can use only a very few spell shards,

17:04.520 --> 17:07.720
and have no spirit shards at all.

17:07.720 --> 17:11.430
I thought that anybody with the
gift for it could use them?

17:11.430 --> 17:13.860
They probably don't have the gift.

17:13.860 --> 17:16.560
One of the reasons they've
brooked Zymot's tyranny

17:16.560 --> 17:19.630
is because no strong shard casters
have been born here.

17:19.630 --> 17:22.600
Because of that, we need you two.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.270
But Rebecca...

17:24.270 --> 17:28.080
That leader, Mr. Kemp, doesn't
seem to want to fight.

17:28.080 --> 17:32.050
Kemp merely doesn't know how to fight.

17:32.050 --> 17:35.170
It's not as if he enjoys being trampled on.

17:36.150 --> 17:39.150
These people deserve our pity.

17:39.150 --> 17:41.620
I want to save them.

17:42.690 --> 17:45.430
I have lost everything...

17:45.430 --> 17:49.160
But it not as if even my hatred
of evil has left me.

17:49.160 --> 17:52.460
This is the time when I must fight.

17:53.100 --> 17:55.070
Is your leader here?

17:55.370 --> 17:58.670
So, the messenger from Zymot is here?

17:59.040 --> 18:01.340
Is your leader here?!

18:08.280 --> 18:12.080
We are deeply indebted to you
for coming all this way.

18:12.550 --> 18:16.090
This time you will give us your answer:

18:16.090 --> 18:18.730
Will you accept the demands of the Zymot Army?

18:18.730 --> 18:21.200
With all due respect,

18:21.200 --> 18:25.400
our citizens have not yet reached a consensus.

18:25.400 --> 18:28.470
As you know, this was quite sudden.

18:28.470 --> 18:33.340
I beg that you will give us a little more time.

18:33.340 --> 18:34.440
No!

18:34.440 --> 18:38.240
You lowly Kalb-Hu want to cause
Zymot time and trouble?

18:38.680 --> 18:40.150
Do as you're told.

18:40.150 --> 18:42.220
Destroy your sanctuary immediately,

18:42.220 --> 18:45.340
and demonstrate your submission
to Zymotan rule!

18:46.790 --> 18:50.560
I am well aware of your displeasure.
However...

18:50.560 --> 18:54.030
Kemp, how can you take such talk quietly?!

18:54.030 --> 18:55.430
Stand down, Guzma.

18:55.430 --> 18:56.960
You stand before the Zymotan messenger.

18:56.960 --> 18:59.030
He's the one who should stand down!

18:59.030 --> 19:01.600
This sanctuary is our home,

19:01.600 --> 19:04.810
and you want me to stand by quietly
while they tell us to destroy it?!

19:04.810 --> 19:09.040
You scum, do you mean to go against Zymot?

19:09.040 --> 19:11.510
You lowly Kalb-Hu!

19:18.790 --> 19:20.750
Y..You're...

19:21.860 --> 19:23.290
Princess Rebecca...

19:23.290 --> 19:25.360
I am a princess no longer.

19:25.360 --> 19:29.660
I have been reborn as a warrior,
to eradicate your army!

19:34.870 --> 19:36.500
Why, you!

19:41.940 --> 19:43.740
This is bad!

19:46.710 --> 19:48.340
What?!

19:53.490 --> 19:54.860
You're Zed!

19:54.860 --> 19:56.360
What are you doing in Kalb-Hu?!

19:56.360 --> 19:58.150
Shut up!

20:16.580 --> 20:17.710
It's a rebellion!

20:17.710 --> 20:18.710
We have to report this!

20:18.710 --> 20:20.680
Go right ahead...

20:22.520 --> 20:24.480
If you can.

20:43.200 --> 20:47.640
Do you mean to sweat two people's work
out of me, with Glaudio gone?

20:47.640 --> 20:50.510
" Sweat" ? I'm hurt.

20:50.510 --> 20:53.210
I merely have confidence in
your ability to do this.

20:53.210 --> 20:55.020
Aren't you enjoying the Kalb-Hu?

20:55.020 --> 20:57.380
Yeah, right!

20:57.380 --> 20:59.490
That's a shame.

20:59.490 --> 21:02.060
But you'll do this for me, won't you?

21:02.060 --> 21:06.260
I suppose I must, if it's the
request of the new king.

21:06.260 --> 21:08.060
Thank you.

21:14.800 --> 21:16.930
This is Rebecca's ...

21:17.840 --> 21:19.470
Oh, ho.

21:24.240 --> 21:26.310
So, she's alive.

21:26.310 --> 21:29.940
She's got some nerve, returning our messenger!

21:33.920 --> 21:36.220
That's my Rebecca.

21:36.220 --> 21:39.520
I underestimated her a little.

21:41.760 --> 21:44.430
But Princess Rebecca...

21:44.430 --> 21:49.870
Kemp, I understand very well your
desire to avoid bloodshed.

21:49.870 --> 21:52.840
But we are up against Zymotans.

21:52.840 --> 21:56.970
They aren't like your people, who love
peace and the rhythms of daily life.

21:57.410 --> 22:00.710
You must steel yourself, and fight!

22:01.750 --> 22:03.850
Princess Rebecca is right!

22:03.850 --> 22:06.050
All of you lend us your hands too!

22:06.050 --> 22:07.990
We are not powerless!

22:07.990 --> 22:10.960
We'll show them that we can fight!

22:13.090 --> 22:14.730
I'll do it.

22:14.730 --> 22:15.830
That's right!

22:15.830 --> 22:18.570
We won't let Zymot throw its weight around here!

22:18.570 --> 22:21.530
We'll show them that we can fight too!

22:22.370 --> 22:24.840
Yeah! Let's do it!

22:30.310 --> 22:33.110
Just you wait, Hugh.

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
Kono michi o tobashite

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:16.950 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
A Wish Unfulfilled

24:17.750 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "A Wish Unfulfilled"
